5,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Hi everyone! I'm Sakura! I'm so excited to play this mystery game with you all!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minato,,Hello. I am Minato. I hope we can all get along and find the truth together.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Takumi,,Hey. I'm Takumi. Let's not waste time. Who is the wolf here?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Mio,,Hi! I'm Mio. I'm really curious about what happens tonight. Let's stay calm.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,Shion here. I prefer to observe before acting. Let's see who blinks first.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"Takumi, you seem a bit aggressive! Are you hiding something? Just kidding!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minato,,I don't think anyone is hiding anything yet. We should just wait for the night.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Takumi,,I'm not hiding anything. I'm just ready to win. Let's see who is scared.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Mio,,I agree with Minato. Let's keep the atmosphere friendly. I don't want to be mean.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Aggression is a common mask. I will watch your reactions closely, Takumi.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Shion, you're so serious! It's just a game, right? Let's have fun!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minato,,I agree with Sakura. Fun is important. But we must also be careful.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Takumi,,Fun is for losers. I want to win. Let's see who is the real wolf.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Mio,,"Takumi, that's a bit harsh! Let's try to be nice to each other, please.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,Harshness is often a sign of guilt. I will keep that in mind.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"Okay, okay! I'll be nice. Good night everyone! I hope we all sleep well!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Minato,,Good night. I will try to sleep peacefully. See you in the morning.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Takumi,,Good night. Let's see who is still alive tomorrow.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
